# `#[post]`

<SymbolMeta />
<SymbolSignature />

POST shorthand for `#[route(POST, path, ...)]` inside an HTTP `#[handlers]` implementation.

```rust
#[post("/")]
async fn create(&self, Json(input): Json<CreateUser>) -> Json<User> { todo!() }
```

It accepts an optional controller-relative string path followed by the shared route modifiers. `#[post]` and `#[post(streamed)]` mount at the controller base. It is a consumed marker, not a standalone function attribute. See [`#[route]`](./route) for complete grammar, modifier rules, containment, generated artifacts, and feature behavior.
